      "signpost": null,
      "definition": "not anything; no thing at all",
      "explanation": "**Nothing** already means **not anything**, so it is not usually joined with **not** in the same clause: *I know nothing about it*, not *I don't know nothing about it*. When it is the subject, it comes before the verb: *Nothing happened*.",
